<title>MEXICO: TABLE-GISA six-month net profit falls.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GISA six-month net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>6-mos 1997		   6-mos 1996</p>
<p>	Shr		n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>	Net		247.93 million	     269.40 million</p>
<p>	Revs	     1.912 bln		1.870 bln</p>
